\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
An Aerodynamic Decoupling Layer
\f0\b0  that calculates instantaneous drag force to prevent motor over-braking.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
A Sigmoidal Thermal Mapping Layer
\f0\b0  that enables smooth, non-linear energy acceptance limits for the battery pack.\
\ls1\ilvl0
